(The root of your DAU stagnation isn't purely about user confusion from the redesigned home screen; it signals a deeper structural) Tj
T* (issue with your product-market fit. To paraphrase Lenny’s insights, successful products often root their foundation in cost efficiency) Tj
T* (and scrappiness. The current flatness in DAU indicates a lack of compelling, sustained engagement with your offering—something) Tj
T* (deeper than just UI tweaks.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (You’ve already tried surface-level diagnostics, but the bet here isn't simply a matter of fixing user experience. Focus on the critical) Tj
T* (operational pain points that your mid-market ops managers face daily and pivot from merely enhancing features to radically) Tj
T* (understanding and addressing these pain points. What operational hurdles are they continually encountering that make them) Tj
T* (disengage? Are they fully leveraging your tool’s capabilities, and if not, why?) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The action item here is to launch an initiative that digs deep into the daily workflow challenges of a subset of users—conduct intimate) Tj
T* (support sessions or shadow a few key users for a week. The insights will demand a transformative approach to the product—not just) Tj
T* (incremental improvements.) Tj
